I'm going to have to disagree, it's just a bad idea to have a random
item with an instadeath effect.  Even amulets of strangulation can be
escaped from with prayer.  There's no problem with a "bad" item
bestowing an effect that makes the game harder, but if it ends it
instantly then new players who are burned by it will become shy of
IDing items from usage, and although that pastime is generally frowned
upon by advanced players, it is still an important part of the game.
